{"id":"vod_bf_9526","vodId":"9526","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"飞翔的魔女","name_cn":"飞翔的魔女","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-10/f7594baa29645473e375ecb2da8504de.jpg"},"summary":"木幡真琴（篠田南 配音）是一名见习魔女，同时亦是一名十五岁的高中一年级女生。魔女界有一个约定俗成的规矩，那就是在十五岁成人礼之后，魔女们便要走上社会开始独自生活，进行魔女的修行。如此，真琴孤身一人来到了青森县，居住在堂兄仓本圭（菅原慎介 配音）家中，转入了这里的高中，开始了崭新的生活。　　在这里，真琴结识了许多善良的朋友们，天真可爱对魔女稍稍有些害怕的仓木千夏（铃木绘里 配音）、家中经营着酒铺的石渡直（三上枝织 配音）、误食了魔法药而在白天会变成狗面的犬养（日野麻里 配音）、和母亲与幽灵雏（金元寿子 配音）一起经营咖啡店的椎名杏子（井口裕香 配音）。在这些朋友们的陪伴下，有笑有泪的剧目拉开了序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 01:02:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/feixiangdemonv/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/feixiangdemonv/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/feixiangdemonv/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/feixiangdemonv/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/feixiangdemonv/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/feixiangdemonv/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/feixiangdemonv/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/feixiangdemonv/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/feixiangdemonv/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/feixiangdemonv/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/feixiangdemonv/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/feixiangdemonv/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:50.068Z"}